# NSEdge

A small Windows companion for the Sony DualSense Edge.

See your active onboard profile, saved profile name and battery status. Get profile-change and battery popups, adjust lighting preferences and keep the app out of the way in the system tray.

**[Download NSEdge](https://github.com/eggntoast/NSEdge/releases)**

Extract the ZIP and run `NSEdge.exe`. Requires Windows 11 x64. The download includes .NET and does not require DS4Windows. The app is unsigned.

### Lighting

Lighting is experimental and off by default. Native USB and Bluetooth output still needs physical testing. NSEdge pauses lighting when stock DS4Windows is running so the two apps do not fight over the controller.

An optional development host has passed Bluetooth colour and restoration checks, but it is not included in this download. Stock DS4Windows 3.3.3 cannot provide that integration on its own. USB coexistence is not yet verified.

### A few limits

Battery levels are approximate. Bluetooth disconnect does not mean controller power-off. Fn + Square profile detection is incomplete.

